# PrintMomentum BE

- Java 21, Spring Boot 4.1.1, package `com.printmomentum`.
- REST under `/api/v1`. JSON only. RFC 7807 for errors once that task lands.
- Official Etsy Open API v3 only. Never scrape etsy.com. Never invent a bestseller timestamp Etsy does not return.
- Read `.cursor/skills/` for domain, Etsy, and REST details instead of browsing the web.
- One git branch per row in `docs/TASKS.csv`. Do not mix unrelated tasks.
- Tests first or with the change. `./mvnw test` must pass.
- Secrets stay in env / `.env` (gitignored). Never commit Etsy keys.
